Modifications Copyright 2026 Jenova Marie

This is a fork of the Replyke client modules (@replyke/*), modified to:

  - repoint the hardcoded API base URL (and chat socket origin) to a self-hosted,
    Replyke-compatible "Agora" backend;
  - re-scope the packages from @replyke/* to @agora-sdk/*;
  - change two auth flows (in files bearing a "Modified from original @replyke/core"
    header): signUpWithEmailAndPassword now resolves to a SignUpResult
    ({ status: "signed_in" | "confirmation_required" }) instead of void to surface the
    email-confirmation flow, and sign-out now always clears local auth state even if the
    server-side token revoke fails.

The original code is the work of Replyke; the @agora-sdk packages are a derivative work
and are NOT affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Replyke. See SYNCING.md for the
full list of divergences and the upstream-merge workflow.

